      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَرْثَدٌ</span></b>  A <i>generous</i> man: (ISk, K:) from <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أَرْثَدَ</span>
signifying “ he reached the moist earth in digging. ”
(ISk.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  And <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">المَرْثَدُ</span> is a name of <i>The lion.</i>
(S, K.)

